partcad-collection-openusd-pixar
================================

This PartCAD package serves Pixar's OpenUSD sample assets as PartCAD parts.

The code in this repository (the `pixar_repo.py` repository plugin, the shared
`usd_assets.py`, the PartCAD configuration and the tests) is:

