No asset is included in this repository. The assets, their layers and their
textures are fetched on demand from https://openusd.org, and remain Pixar's,
under Pixar's USD Asset End User License Agreement
(https://openusd.org/release/dl_kitchen_set.html): Copyright Disney/Pixar.
Nothing is fetched until the user has accepted that agreement.

